   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two little dashes and a little circle",
     "texto": [
      "With two little dashes (゛) at the top right, the consonant becomes **voiced**: か ka → **が ga**, さ sa → **ざ za**, た ta → **だ da**, は ha → **ば ba**.",
      "With a little circle (゜), the h row becomes **p**: は ha → **ぱ pa**.",
      "Exceptions: **じ** is read «ji» (like the j in «jeans») and **づ**, hardly used, «zu»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
